# Secrets. `.env.*` rather than a list of known names: docs/DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md
# tells the operator to create `.env.production` inside this directory, and the
# old rules matched only `.env`, `.env.local` and `.env.*.local` — a real
# production secrets file would have been committable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

